   Sangyo Univ; Univ Minho; Springer Nat Switzerland AG},
Abstract = {This article shows the results obtained in the application of State
   Estimation to a case of fault detection and diagnosis in an osmotic
   dehydration process. The disturbances that affect the measurements on
   the system are unknown but it is known that they are bounded. The tools
   used for the development of this work were the EMV (Extended Mean Value)
